---
Add synth preset preview in track sound selector.

When hovering or clicking a synth preset in the selector dropdown,
play a short preview note with that preset.

## Acceptance Criteria
- [ ] Clicking a preset in dropdown triggers a preview note (e.g. C4, 0.5s)
- [ ] Preview uses temporary voice, not track voice pool
- [ ] Preview stops when dropdown closes
- [ ] All preset types (subtractive, FM, wavetable) preview correctly

## Test Plan
- [ ] Open synth selector, click presets, verify preview note plays
- [ ] Verify preview works for sub, FM, and WT presets
- [ ] Close dropdown, verify preview stops cleanly
